# Deprecated advice appendix

This file is retained temporarily for compatibility with older imports. It is
not imported by the revised general doctrine and must not receive new content.

The former generic advice has been consolidated into `Agent/doctrine` and the
shared doctrine documents. Scout-specific conventions belong in the relevant
role start_chat or subsystem reference:

- ScoutDocumentation lookup belongs in the relevant Scout-aware role or
  workflow guide.
- Workspace and non-Workspace file-placement rules belong in the relevant
  tool contracts.
- Unit-test placement and test-template conventions belong in ScoutCoder's
  instructions and developer documentation.

Before deleting this file, search the repository for remaining imports of
`Agent/doctrines/advice` and migrate them deliberately.
